OL,3,CMan faces murder charge over fatal
OL,4,Cstabbing in Clapham High Street
OL,6,FA 22 year old man has been charged
OL,7,Fwith murder over the death of a man in
OL,8,FClapham in the early hours of Saturday
OL,9,Fmorning.
OL,11,FJaved Khan is accused of stabbing
OL,12,FAbdulkadir Mahamed to death.
OL,14,FHe also faces a charge of violent
OL,15,Fdisorder on Clapham High Street
OL,16,Farising from the same incident.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/6
