OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1785412110
OL,3,CMan faces murder charge over fatal
OL,4,Cstabbing in Clapham High Street
OL,6,FThe 22 year old is due to appear at
OL,7,FBromley Magistrates' Court on Monday,
OL,8,Falongside a second man, Adonay Berhan
OL,9,Fwho is accused of assisting an
OL,10,Foffender.
OL,12,FThe Metropolitan Police were called at
OL,13,F4.37am on Saturday morning after
OL,14,Freports that Mr Mahamed had been taken
OL,15,Fto hospital with stab wounds.
OL,17,FHe died later the same morning.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/6
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
