OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1785412110
OL,3,CMan faces murder charge over fatal
OL,4,Cstabbing in Clapham High Street
OL,6,FThe Met said six men were arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of murder, including three
OL,8,Faged 22 and a fourth aged 24 who had
OL,9,Falso been taken to hospital with stab
OL,10,Fwounds.
OL,12,FOn Monday, Scotland Yard said a 25-
OL,13,Fyear-old man arrested on suspicion of
OL,14,Fmurder remains in custody, after
OL,15,Freceiving hospital treatment for
OL,16,Finjuries.
OL,18,FThe men treated in hospital for stab
OL,19,Fwounds have now been released with no
OL,20,Ffurther action.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/6
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
