OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1785412110
OL,3,CMan faces murder charge over fatal
OL,4,Cstabbing in Clapham High Street
OL,6,FSuperintendent Mark Gallacher, a
OL,7,Fpolicing lead for the area, said on
OL,8,FSaturday:
OL,10,F"This is a tragic incident and our
OL,11,Fofficers continue to support the
OL,12,Ffamily of the young man who has sadly
OL,13,Fdied.
OL,15,F"We understand that this will cause
OL,16,Fconcern among the local community and
OL,17,Fspecialist detectives are doing
OL,18,Feverything possible to determine what
OL,19,Fhas happened.
OL,26,@rD@AOUwD@AOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/6
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1785412110
OL,3,CMan faces murder charge over fatal
OL,4,Cstabbing in Clapham High Street
OL,6,F"We are asking anyone with any
OL,7,Finformation or anyone who may have
OL,8,Fwitnessed anything in the early hours
OL,9,Fto contact us and support with the
OL,10,Fongoing investigation."
OL,12,FPolice said they believe Mr Mahamad
OL,13,Fwas stabbed close to Tremadoc Road in
OL,14,FClapham.
OL,16,FAccording to the charges, Berhan is
OL,17,Faccused of driving away from the
OL,18,Fscene, allegedly to "impede the
OL,19,Fapprehension or prosecution" of a
OL,20,Fthird man who is also suspected of
OL,21,Fmurder.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@WO]zD@UOU{D@\O]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/6
