OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1785412110
OL,3,CMan faces murder charge over fatal
OL,4,Cstabbing in Clapham High Street
OL,6,FBoth Khan, of Wimbledon, and Berhan,
OL,7,Ffrom Croydon, are in custody and are
OL,8,Fexpected to appear in court later on
OL,9,FMonday.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G6/6
